The fresh partial materialization is retained with zero index entries. No new local
commit, no overlay application and no Linux build. Do not interpret its baseline
HEAD reference as a completed source snapshot or run/build from this tree.

TLS/private credentials and QUIC were untouched. Original dirty sources, all prior
evidence, existing images/volumes/caches were preserved. Missing baseline inputs
and the failed cache-command path must be resolved before dependent work; no cold
