''', encoding='utf-8')
(out / 'independent-review.md').write_text('''# Independent prerequisite review

Reviewer /root/kar_positive_review read the retained outcomes/scripts and known
publication snapshots without edits or live operations. Native containment result
supports that one case only. Docker metadata establishes Linux/amd64 image presence,
not usable toolchain/cache contents. Cache probe remains failed with retained
