Correction applied before sealing this bundle: stdout/stderr files exist and are
empty; reply.json is absent. Earlier draft wording claiming output files absent
was unsupported. No exact matches for the three missing baseline Git blobs were
established from known publication snapshots or in-memory reversal of the retained
